{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん〜〜〜〜〜！ななせまる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポケットモンスターXを手に入れました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワクワク"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/nanase.nishino/img/2013/11/09/0420595/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぺち！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"町一番の踊り子 役"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶賛 若月に片想い中！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな綺麗な着物、今まで見たことないとです。着ることができて嬉しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が、終始、呼吸が苦しくて大変でした(つД`)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔の人はすごいですねぇと衣装さんと話してました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/nanase.nishino/img/2013/11/09/0420595/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時代劇やりたいって思ってたから、今回できて嬉しいですW(`0`)W"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのガサガサした感じの映像がよきかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MVは予告編ということでしたが、...本編も撮らないかしら〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"FRIDAYの撮影をしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年の夏、7人で学校で撮影した時のを見てから行きましたえへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひご覧下さい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この夏〜秋は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"氣志團フェス"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めざましライブ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"HALLOWEEN PARTY 2013"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロックの学園"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragrap